      <activity id="218b0e22-ba9c-5d05-9b8c-b2412a937399" activityNameId="8e4f2d23-0c13-59e8-87db-cfa04eb003bf" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, natural gas, offshore pipeline, long distance</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, natural gas, offshore pipeline, long distance
Infrastructure requirements are based on estimated standard capacity. UUID=032e8c77-8398-31bd-b400-d989f3a5cbc5
This dataset describes the energy consumption and the emissions linked to the transport of Norwegian natural gas in an offshore pipeline.
Location: The data for emissions are based on European data and for energy requirements on German data.
Technology: Long-distance transport offshore with  average compressor station.
Time period: The data for emissions is from 2006, the data for energy requirements from 2001
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_032e8c77-8398-31bd-b400-d989f3a5cbc5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="d4421e85-4eb7-535c-9a92-4641795139a0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
